# Household
### Gets all households
GET http://localhost:5260/api/Households

### Gets the household with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Households/1

### Gets the household with id 999, should return 404 if it doesn't exist

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Households/999

### Adds a new household

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Households
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aa"
}

### Should return 400 with a message explaining minimum length of 2 required

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Households
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A"
}

### Updates household name for id 2

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Households/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Changed household name"
}

### Testing if update runs with no changes, should return 200

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Households/2
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Deletes household with id 2, should return 404 on get afterwards

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/Households/2

# ChoreInstance
### Creates new instance with new chore

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/new-chore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mop the floors",
  "householdId": 1,
  "periodStartDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00+01:00"
}

### Creates new instance from chore with id 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choreId": 1,
  "periodStartDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00+01:00"
}

### Get choreinstance with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/1

### Get all choreinstances for household with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances?householdId=1

### Marks instance with id 1 as done

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/1/mark-as-done

### Clears done date for instance with id 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/1/clear-done-date

### Delete choreinstance with id 1

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/1

### Instance for a chore that doesn't exist, should return 404

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "choreId": 999,
  "periodStartDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00+01:00"
}

# Chore
### Gets all chores

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Chores?householdId=1

### Gets chore with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1

### Gets chore 999, should return 404

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/999

### Updates name on chore with id 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Changed chore name"
}

### Assigns chore 1 to user 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

### Adds a weekly rule to chore 1 (frequency 1 = Weekly)

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "frequency": 1
}

### Sets weekdays to Monday + Wednesday + Friday (1 + 4 + 16 = 21)

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "frequency": 1,
  "weekdays": 21
}

### Interval without frequency, should return 400

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "interval": 2
}

### Weekdays without frequency, should return 400

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weekdays": 1
}

### Creates a new chore with a weekly rule on Mondays

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ChoreInstances/new-chore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buy milk",
  "householdId": 1,
  "frequency": 1,
  "weekdays": 1,
  "periodStartDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00+01:00"
}

### Changes name on chore 2 for the future, should return a NEW chore with a new id and the same rule

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/2/update-future
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buy oat milk"
}

### Nothing changed, should return chore 2 itself (same id, no new chore created)

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/2/update-future
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Buy milk"
}

### Chore without a rule, should return 404

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Chores/1/update-future
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Whatever"
}

# Product
### Creates a product

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Milk",
  "householdId": 1
}

### Gets all products for household 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Products?householdId=1

### Gets product with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Products/1

### Updates product name

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oat milk"
}

### Deletes product with id 1

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/Products/1

# ShoppingItem
### Creates a shopping item for product 1 (unit 4 = Liter)

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 2,
  "unit": 4
}

### Shopping item for a product that doesn't exist, should return 404

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 999,
  "amount": 2,
  "unit": 4
}

### Amount of 0, should return 400

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 0,
  "unit": 4
}

### Gets all shopping items for household 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems?householdId=1

### Gets shopping item with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems/1

### Updates amount on shopping item 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 3
}

### Marks shopping item 1 as bought

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems/1/mark-as-bought

### Clears bought date on shopping item 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems/1/clear-bought-date

### Deletes shopping item 1

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/ShoppingItems/1

# Recipe
### Creates a recipe

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pancakes",
  "instructions": "Mix and fry.",
  "servings": 4,
  "householdId": 1
}

### Gets all recipes for household 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes?householdId=1

### Gets recipe with id 1

GET http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/1

### Updates recipe 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servings": 6
}

### Adds an ingredient to recipe 1 (product 1, unit 3 = Deciliter)

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/1/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 5,
  "unit": 3
}

### Updates ingredient 1

POST http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 7
}

### Deletes ingredient 1

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/ingredients/1

### Deletes recipe 1

DELETE http://localhost:5260/api/Recipes/1
